{"type":"say","text":"Good, this is exactly why we do these huddles. Let me summarize what I'm hearing: SPC Hale is only qualified for the night shift, so that's where he needs to go. CPL Morris is out entirely for Wednesday — no shifts, no reserve. SGT Ibarra is directed by battalion to be on the day shift. That leaves PFC Cole to cover swing and serve as reserve. So the roster would be: Day — SGT Ibarra, Swing — PFC Cole, Night — SPC Hale, Reserve — PFC Cole. Wait, that puts Cole on swing and as reserve, which won't work if Cole is actually operating the swing shift. Let me reconsider — with only two fully available personnel after constraints, we have Ibarra on day, Hale on night, and Cole on swing. That leaves no one for reserve. Does anyone have any additional information or flexibility before I make a decision?"}
```

